Job Summary
 We are looking for a detail-oriented Business Analyst to support digital transformation initiatives within a highly regulated environment. This role involves driving end-to-end business analysis activities across solution design, testing, implementation, and post-go-live support, requiring strong stakeholder management, analytical thinking, and regulatory awareness.

 Mandatory Skill-set
 Bachelor’s Degree in IT, Computer Science, Business, Engineering, or related field;
 Must have at least 4 years of experience as a Business Analyst or similar role;
 Strong experience in requirements gathering, process analysis, and functional documentation;
 Hands-on experience supporting SIT/UAT, defect management, and implementation activities;
 Good experience in designing customer-servicing platforms or customer-facing digital channels;
 Experience working in regulated environments such as hospitality, financial services, government, or similar industries;
 Familiar with Agile, Waterfall, or hybrid SDLC methodologies;
 Strong stakeholder management and communication skills across business, IT, compliance, and vendors.

